  ('duck', 'MN', 'Statewide', NULL, 'not_published', NULL, NULL, 'NOT YET PUBLISHED. Minnesota''s 2026-27 regular duck season dates, zone structure and bag limits are not posted. The DNR waterfowl page (https://www.dnr.state.mn.us/hunting/waterfowl/index.html) states verbatim: ''Information for 2026 waterfowl hunting will be posted online by Aug. 1,'' and flags the current content as ''Information on this page is out-of-date, may be inaccurate and remains available for historical reference only.'' The current regulations booklet (https://files.dnr.state.mn.us/rlp/regulations/hunting/waterfowl.pdf) is still titled ''Effective September 2025 through April 30, 2026.'' The season-dates calendar lists only a single 2026 waterfowl entry — ''09/26/26 | Waterfowl | Statewide'' — i.e. the statewide opener date with NO closing date and NO zone rows. Related 2026 dates that ARE posted: Teal 09/05/26-09/09/26 statewide; Youth Waterfowl Hunt 09/12/26-09/13/26 statewide. MN has historically run north/central/south duck zones, but the 2026-27 zone structure is not confirmed on any official page, so no zone records are asserted here. Zero dates carried forward from 2025-26. Re-check on or after Aug 1, 2026. This is a genuine publication gap, not a state-labeled ''tentative'' status — provisional is false because Minnesota has published no dates to label.', 'https://www.dnr.state.mn.us/hunting/waterfowl/seasons.html', '2026-07-25T01:04:41Z', 'high', '2026-08-01', '1'),
  ('goose', 'MN', 'Statewide', NULL, 'not_published', NULL, NULL, 'NOT YET PUBLISHED. Minnesota''s 2026-27 REGULAR goose season dates, goose zone structure and bag limits are not posted; same DNR statement applies: ''Information for 2026 waterfowl hunting will be posted online by Aug. 1.'' The only 2026-27 goose dates currently on the official calendar are for separate special seasons, NOT the regular season: September Goose 09/12/26-09/27/26 (no zone listed) and Spring light goose conservation order 02/18/27-04/30/27 statewide. A sandhill crane season 09/19/26-10/17/26 is listed for the ''Northwest goose zone,'' which confirms the goose-zone geography exists but gives no regular goose season dates. The current MN waterfowl regulations booklet still covers September 2025 - April 30, 2026. Zero dates carried forward from 2025-26. Re-check on or after Aug 1, 2026.', 'https://www.dnr.state.mn.us/hunting/waterfowl/seasons.html', '2026-07-25T01:04:41Z', 'high', '2026-08-01', '1'),
