  ('duck', 'SC', 'Statewide', NULL, 'not_published', NULL, NULL, '2026-2027 NOT YET PUBLISHED - HONEST GAP, dates deliberately empty. SCDNR''s own season-dates PDF at this URL is still headed ''2025-2026 Migratory Bird Seasons / Approved by the DNR Board / March 28, 2025'' as of this fetch. Checked and found nothing newer at: dnr.sc.gov/hunting/migratory.html, dnr.sc.gov/hunting/waterfowl.html, dnr.sc.gov/regulations.html, and the SCDNR-linked official digest at eregulations.com/southcarolina/hunting/general-migratory-bird-seasons-shooting-hours-bag-limits (also still 2025-2026). Probed several dated PDF filename variants - all 404. SC''s 2026-2027 Hunting and Fishing Laws and Regulations Guide is stated to be due online and in print in early August 2026. Last season''s structure, for shape only and explicitly NOT carried forward as data: ducks statewide, no zones, Nov 22-29 and Dec 12-Jan 31, bag 6. RE-CHECK AFTER AUGUST 1, 2026.', 'https://www.dnr.sc.gov/hunting/SCMigratoryBirdSeasons.pdf', '2026-07-25T01:05:02Z', 'high', '2026-08-01', '1'),
