  ('duck', 'WV', 'Statewide', NULL, 'not_published', NULL, NULL, 'NOT YET PUBLISHED. WVDNR released its 2026-2027 Hunting and Trapping Regulations Summary (PDF dated 2026-07-24) but it defers all waterfowl dates to a separate Migratory Bird Hunting Regulations publication stated as ''available in August''. The only migratory-bird PDF currently posted at wvdnr.gov/hunting-regulations is the SEPTEMBER 2025 edition (2025-26 season) — do not carry those dates forward. The one waterfowl date the 2026-27 summary does print is youth waterfowl: ''Waterfowl: Sept. 19 and Oct. 31, 2026''. Re-check wvdnr.gov/hunting-regulations in August 2026. Historically WV runs a statewide duck season with multiple segments; zone structure for 2026-27 is unconfirmed, so ''Statewide'' here is a placeholder, not a transcribed value.', 'https://wvdnr.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Pub_Regs_HuntTrap_202627_DNR_WILD_20260724.pdf', '2026-07-25T01:03:37Z', 'high', '2026-08-01', '1'),
